==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 10 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Alcremie Drop Event]], which ran from July 2 to 12, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Audino|87}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*'''Drain Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Audino|108}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

